WEBVTT

00:07.100 --> 00:12.820
I was red clay in the potter's hand

00:13.940 --> 00:16.160
Shaped for glory, made to stand

00:17.280 --> 00:20.220
But I reached for the fruit with a fist of pride

00:20.660 --> 00:23.840
And I've been tasting the dust since the day I died

00:24.120 --> 00:27.200
I wore my Sunday clothes like a cover-up

00:28.080 --> 00:30.960
Sang every hymn with an empty cup

00:32.000 --> 00:34.760
Dead in my sin, Ephesians two

00:35.620 --> 00:38.140
A walking grave in a wooden pew

00:39.060 --> 00:40.660
Can these bones live?

00:41.280 --> 00:41.920
Lord, You know

00:42.180 --> 00:44.060
I got nothing to give

00:44.520 --> 00:45.760
And nowhere to go

00:46.580 --> 00:50.560
But You breathed on the dust and the dust stood up

00:50.820 --> 00:53.940
You spoke to the dead and the dead woke up

00:54.000 --> 00:57.540
Now every breath I've got is a borrowed song

00:58.420 --> 01:01.120
Raised by grace and running home

01:01.520 --> 01:03.020
Oh, I was dust, now I'm breath

01:03.180 --> 01:04.800
Called by name out of death

01:04.920 --> 01:07.520
I'll spend it all till my last breath is gone

01:08.580 --> 01:14.580
Raised by grace and running home

01:21.260 --> 01:23.600
There's a hill outside the city wall

01:23.720 --> 01:27.220
Where the Righteous One took the sinner's fall

01:28.340 --> 01:31.920
Every nail that I earned went into His hands

01:32.060 --> 01:35.500
He became my sin so I could stand

01:36.060 --> 01:39.100
Three days dark in a borrowed tomb

01:39.320 --> 01:42.740
Then the stone rolled back like a door to a room

01:42.860 --> 01:46.860
And the voice that hollered "Lazarus, come"

01:47.080 --> 01:49.840
Said my name like He'd already won

01:50.040 --> 01:51.680
Can these bones live?

01:51.800 --> 01:52.540
Now I know

01:52.880 --> 01:54.700
It's the cross where He gives

01:54.880 --> 01:56.420
What I could never owe

01:57.400 --> 02:00.980
'Cause You breathed on the dust and the dust stood up

02:01.080 --> 02:04.380
You spoke to the dead and the dead woke up

02:04.380 --> 02:07.880
Now every breath I've got is a borrowed song

02:08.680 --> 02:11.480
Raised by grace and running home

02:11.700 --> 02:13.360
Oh, I was dust, now I'm breath

02:13.500 --> 02:15.140
Called by name out of death

02:15.220 --> 02:17.520
I'll spend it all till my last breath is gone

02:18.400 --> 02:25.180
Raised by grace and running home

02:26.040 --> 02:27.720
Where's your sting, O death

02:28.040 --> 02:29.460
Where's your win, O grave

02:29.580 --> 02:31.440
He walked right out with the keys

02:31.760 --> 02:33.240
And He took my chains

02:33.780 --> 02:35.180
Rattle in the valley

02:35.840 --> 02:36.800
Bone to bone

02:37.360 --> 02:38.380
Sinew and skin

02:38.860 --> 02:40.380
Wind blowing in

02:40.520 --> 02:42.060
Where's your sting, O death

02:42.280 --> 02:43.780
Where's your win, O grave

02:43.820 --> 02:45.620
I was a dead man walking

02:45.900 --> 02:47.780
Now I'm walking with the One who saves

02:48.020 --> 02:51.080
You breathed on the dust and the dust stood up

02:51.220 --> 02:54.420
You spoke to the dead and the dead woke up

02:54.520 --> 02:57.860
Now every breath I've got is a borrowed song

02:58.600 --> 03:01.440
Raised by grace and running home

03:01.720 --> 03:03.320
Oh, I was dust, now I'm breath

03:03.500 --> 03:05.080
Called by name out of death

03:05.240 --> 03:07.680
I'll spend it all till my last breath is gone

03:08.300 --> 03:14.860
Raised by grace and running home

03:17.660 --> 03:18.540
Dust and breath

03:20.980 --> 03:22.120
Dust and breath

03:24.360 --> 03:26.220
Raised by grace

03:29.780 --> 03:30.740
Running home
